@startuml courier-layers

' Replaces the ASCII "shape of it" diagram in explanation/couriers.md.
' Verified against App\Facades\Courier, App\Support\Courier\CourierManager,
' App\Support\Courier\CachedCourierGateway, App\Contracts\CourierGateway,
' App\Http\Integrations\{Econt,Speedy} on 2026-09-07.

title The courier layer, end to end (explanation/couriers.md)

skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor<<facade>> #E8F0FF
  BackgroundColor<<decorator>> #FFF5E0
  BackgroundColor<<contract>> #E0F5E0
  BackgroundColor<<vendor>> #FFE0E0
}

package "Callers" {
  [CheckoutPage /\nCalculateDeliveryPrice] as Checkout
  [Actions\\Order\\CreateOrder] as CreateOrder
}

component "App\\Facades\\Courier" as Facade <<facade>>
component "App\\Support\\Courier\\CourierManager" as Manager <<facade>>
note bottom of Manager
  Resolves a driver by carriers.code,
  wraps it in CachedCourierGateway
end note

component "App\\Support\\Courier\\CachedCourierGateway\n(decorator)" as Cache <<decorator>>
note bottom of Cache
  Caches cities()/offices()/quote();
  createShipment()/label()/track()
  always pass through uncached —
  see troubleshooting/infra-and-environment.md
  for why caching the DTOs directly
  is the wrong move here
end note

component "App\\Contracts\\CourierGateway\n(§37 #14 — one interface, two vendors)" as Contract <<contract>>
component "EcontGateway" as Econt <<contract>>
component "SpeedyGateway" as Speedy <<contract>>
note bottom of Contract
  Maps vendor JSON → App\\Support\\Courier
  DTOs, never the reverse
end note

component "App\\Http\\Integrations\\Econt\n(Saloon connector + requests)" as EcontHttp <<vendor>>
component "App\\Http\\Integrations\\Speedy\n(Saloon connector + requests)" as SpeedyHttp <<vendor>>
note bottom of EcontHttp
  Vendor HTTP, auth, and the
  per-vendor "200 with an error
  body" trap
end note

Checkout --> Facade : Courier::for($carrier)\n->offices($city) / ->quote(...)
CreateOrder --> Manager : CourierManager (injected)\n->for($carrier)->quote(...)

Facade --> Manager
Manager --> Cache
Cache --> Contract
Contract <|.. Econt
Contract <|.. Speedy
Econt --> EcontHttp
Speedy --> SpeedyHttp

@enduml
